05CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">204</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">send</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"rest-的痛点\">REST 的痛点</h3><p><strong>Over-fetching（过度获取）</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant C as 移动端&#10;    participant S as REST API&#10;&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: GET /api/users/123&#10;    S--&gt;&gt;C: { id, name, email, avatar,&lt;br/&gt;address, phone, bio,&lt;br/&gt;preferences, ... }&#10;    Note over C: 我只需要 name 和 avatar&lt;br/&gt;但收到了完整的用户对象\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant C as 移动端\n    participant S as REST API\n\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: GET /api/users/123\n    S--&gt;&gt;C: { id, name, email, avatar,&lt;br/&gt;address, phone, bio,&lt;br/&gt;preferences, ... }\n    Note over C: 我只需要 name 和 avatar&lt;br/&gt;但收到了完整的用户对象</pre><p><strong>Under-fetching（获取不足）</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant C as 客户端&#10;    participant S as REST API&#10;&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: GET /api/posts/456&#10;    S--&gt;&gt;C: { id, title, authorId: 123 }&#10;&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: GET /api/users/123&#10;    S--&gt;&gt;C: { id, name, avatar }&#10;&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: GET /api/posts/456/comments&#10;    S--&gt;&gt;C: [{ id, text, userId: 789 }, ...]&#10;&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: GET /api/users/789&#10;    S--&gt;&gt;C: { id, name, avatar }&#10;&#10;    Note over C: 展示一个帖子详情&lt;br/&gt;需要 4 次 API 调用\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant C as 客户端\n    participant S as REST API\n\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: GET /api/posts/456\n    S--&gt;&gt;C: { id, title, authorId: 123 }\n\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: GET /api/users/123\n    S--&gt;&gt;C: { id, name, avatar }\n\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: GET /api/posts/456/comments\n    S--&gt;&gt;C: [{ id, text, userId: 789 }, ...]\n\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: GET /api/users/789\n    S--&gt;&gt;C: { id, name, avatar }\n\n    Note over C: 展示一个帖子详情&lt;br/&gt;需要 4 次 API 调用</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"graphql-客户端驱动的灵活查询\">GraphQL：客户端驱动的灵活查询</h2><p>GraphQL 由 Facebook 于 2015 年开源，核心理念是让客户端精确描述需要的数据，服务端返回恰好满足需求的结果。</p>\n<h3 id=\"schema-定义\">Schema 定义</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"graphql\" data-code=\"type User {&#10;  id: ID!&#10;  name: String!&#10;  email: String!&#10;  avatar: String&#10;  posts(limit: Int = 10): [Post!]!&#10;  followers: [User!]!&#10;  followersCount: Int!&#10;}&#10;&#10;type Post {&#10;  id: ID!&#10;  title: String!&#10;  content: String!&#10;  author: User!&#10;  comments(limit: Int = 20): [Comment!]!&#10;  createdAt: String!&#10;}&#10;&#10;type Comment {&#10;  id: ID!&#10;  text: String!&#10;  author: User!&#10;  createdAt: String!&#10;}&#10;&#10;type Query {&#10;  user(id: ID!): User&#10;  post(id: ID!): Post&#10;  feed(page: Int, limit: Int): [Post!]!&#10;}&#10;&#10;type Mutation {&#10;  createPost(title: String!, content: String!): Post!&#10;  addComment(postId: ID!, text: String!): Comment!&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>type User {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  id: ID!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  name: String!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  email: String!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  avatar: String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  posts(limit: Int = 10): [Post!]!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  followers: [User!]!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  followersCount: Int!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type Post {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  id: ID!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  title: String!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  content: String!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  author: User!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  comments(limit: Int = 20): [Comment!]!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  createdAt: String!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type Comment {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  id: ID!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  text: String!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  author: User!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  createdAt: String!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type Query {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  user(id: ID!): User</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  post(id: ID!): Post</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  feed(page: Int, limit: Int): [Post!]!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type Mutation {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  createPost(title: String!, content: String!): Post!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  addComment(postId: ID!, text: String!): Comment!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"灵活查询\">灵活查询</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant C as 客户端&#10;    participant S as GraphQL 服务器&#10;&#10;    Note over C: 单次请求获取所有需要的数据&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: query {&lt;br/&gt;  post(id: &quot;456&quot;) {&lt;br/&gt;    title&lt;br/&gt;    author { name avatar }&lt;br/&gt;    comments(limit: 5) {&lt;br/&gt;      text&lt;br/&gt;      author { name }&lt;br/&gt;    }&lt;br/&gt;  }&lt;br/&gt;}&#10;    S--&gt;&gt;C: 精确返回请求的字段&#10;    Note over C: 一次调用替代了 REST 的 4 次调用\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant C as 客户端\n    participant S as GraphQL 服务器\n\n    Note over C: 单次请求获取所有需要的数据\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: query {&lt;br/&gt;  post(id: \"456\") {&lt;br/&gt;    title&lt;br/&gt;    author { name avatar }&lt;br/&gt;    comments(limit: 5) {&lt;br/&gt;      text&lt;br/&gt;      author { name }&lt;br/&gt;    }&lt;br/&gt;  }&lt;br/&gt;}\n    S--&gt;&gt;C: 精确返回请求的字段\n    Note over C: 一次调用替代了 REST 的 4 次调用</pre><h3 id=\"graphql-的挑战\">GraphQL 的挑战</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>挑战</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>应对方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>N+1 查询</td>\n<td>嵌套解析导致大量数据库查询</td>\n<td>DataLoader 批量加载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查询复杂度</td>\n<td>恶意客户端可以构造深度嵌套的查询</td>\n<td>查询深度限制、复杂度分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缓存困难</td>\n<td>单一端点，无法使用 HTTP 缓存</td>\n<td>持久化查询、CDN 集成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文件上传</td>\n<td>GraphQL 规范不支持文件上传</td>\n<td>多部分请求或单独的 REST 端点</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"grpc-高性能二进制通信\">gRPC：高性能二进制通信</h2><p>gRPC 由 Google 开发，使用 Protocol Buffers 作为序列化格式，基于 HTTP/2 传输。它特别适合微服务之间的内部通信。</p>\n<h3 id=\"protocol-buffers-定义\">Protocol Buffers 定义</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"protobuf\" data-code=\"syntax = &quot;proto3&quot;;&#10;&#10;package userservice;&#10;&#10;service UserService {&#10;  rpc GetUser (GetUserRequest) returns (UserResponse);&#10;  rpc ListUsers (ListUsersRequest) returns (ListUsersResponse);&#10;  rpc CreateUser (CreateUserRequest) returns (UserResponse);&#10;  rpc StreamUpdates (StreamRequest) returns (stream UserEvent);&#10;}&#10;&#10;message GetUserRequest {&#10;  string id = 1;&#10;}&#10;&#10;message ListUsersRequest {&#10;  int32 page = 1;&#10;  int32 limit = 2;&#10;}&#10;&#10;message CreateUserRequest {&#10;  string name = 1;&#10;  string email = 2;&#10;}&#10;&#10;message UserResponse {&#10;  string id = 1;&#10;  string name = 2;&#10;  string email = 3;&#10;  int64 created_at = 4;&#10;}&#10;&#10;message ListUsersResponse {&#10;  repeated UserResponse users = 1;&#10;  int32 total = 2;&#10;}&#10;&#10;message StreamRequest {&#10;  string filter = 1;&#10;}&#10;&#10;message UserEvent {&#10;  string type = 1;&#10;  UserResponse user = 2;&#10;  int64 timestamp = 3;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>syntax = \"proto3\";</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>package userservice;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>service UserService {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  rpc GetUser (GetUserRequest) returns (UserResponse);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  rpc ListUsers (ListUsersRequest) returns (ListUsersResponse);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  rpc CreateUser (CreateUserRequest) returns (UserResponse);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  rpc StreamUpdates (StreamRequest) returns (stream UserEvent);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>message GetUserRequest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  string id = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>message ListUsersRequest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  int32 page = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  int32 limit = 2;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>message CreateUserRequest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  string name = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  string email = 2;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>message UserResponse {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  string id = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  string name = 2;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  string email = 3;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  int64 created_at = 4;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>message ListUsersResponse {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  repeated UserResponse users = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  int32 total = 2;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>message StreamRequest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  string filter = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>message UserEvent {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  string type = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  UserResponse user = 2;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  int64 timestamp = 3;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"grpc-的四种通信模式\">gRPC 的四种通信模式</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 一元调用 Unary&#10;        C1[客户端] --&gt;|单个请求| S1[服务端]&#10;        S1 --&gt;|单个响应| C1&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 服务端流 Server Streaming&#10;        C2[客户端] --&gt;|单个请求| S2[服务端]&#10;        S2 --&gt;|响应流| C2&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 客户端流 Client Streaming&#10;        C3[客户端] --&gt;|请求流| S3[服务端]&#10;        S3 --&gt;|单个响应| C3&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 双向流 Bidirectional&#10;        C4[客户端] &lt;--&gt;|双向流| S4[服务端]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph 一元调用 Unary\n        C1[客户端] --&gt;|单个请求| S1[服务端]\n        S1 --&gt;|单个响应| C1\n    end\n    subgraph 服务端流 Server Streaming\n        C2[客户端] --&gt;|单个请求| S2[服务端]\n        S2 --&gt;|响应流| C2\n    end\n    subgraph 客户端流 Client Streaming\n        C3[客户端] --&gt;|请求流| S3[服务端]\n        S3 --&gt;|单个响应| C3\n    end\n    subgraph 双向流 Bidirectional\n        C4[客户端] &lt;--&gt;|双向流| S4[服务端]\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"三种范式对比\">三种范式对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>REST</th>\n<th>GraphQL</th>\n<th>gRPC</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据格式</td>\n<td>JSON</td>\n<td>JSON</td>\n<td>Protocol Buffers</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>传输协议</td>\n<td>HTTP/1.1 或 HTTP/2</td>\n<td>HTTP</td>\n<td>HTTP/2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>序列化大小</td>\n<td>较大</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>最小（二进制）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型安全</td>\n<td>需额外工具（OpenAPI）</td>\n<td>Schema 内置</td>\n<td>.proto 文件内置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>浏览器支持</td>\n<td>原生支持</td>\n<td>原生支持</td>\n<td>需要 gRPC-Web 代理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学习曲线</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流式传输</td>\n<td>不原生支持</td>\n<td>Subscription</td>\n<td>原生支持四种模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缓存</td>\n<td>HTTP 缓存原生支持</td>\n<td>需要额外处理</td>\n<td>需要额外处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>公开 API、简单 CRUD</td>\n<td>多样化客户端、复杂查询</td>\n<td>微服务内部通信</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"选型决策树\">选型决策树</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Start[选择 API 范式] --&gt; Q1{面向外部还是内部?}&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|外部/公开 API| Q2{客户端数据需求多样?}&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|是| GQL[GraphQL]&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|否| REST[REST]&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|内部/微服务| Q3{需要流式通信?}&#10;    Q3 --&gt;|是| GRPC1[gRPC]&#10;    Q3 --&gt;|否| Q4{性能要求极高?}&#10;    Q4 --&gt;|是| GRPC2[gRPC]&#10;    Q4 --&gt;|否| Q5{团队熟悉度?}&#10;    Q5 --&gt;|REST 经验丰富| REST2[REST]&#10;    Q5 --&gt;|愿意学习新技术| GRPC3[gRPC]\">flowchart TD\n    Start[选择 API 范式] --&gt; Q1{面向外部还是内部?}\n    Q1 --&gt;|外部/公开 API| Q2{客户端数据需求多样?}\n    Q2 --&gt;|是| GQL[GraphQL]\n    Q2 --&gt;|否| REST[REST]\n    Q1 --&gt;|内部/微服务| Q3{需要流式通信?}\n    Q3 --&gt;|是| GRPC1[gRPC]\n    Q3 --&gt;|否| Q4{性能要求极高?}\n    Q4 --&gt;|是| GRPC2[gRPC]\n    Q4 --&gt;|否| Q5{团队熟悉度?}\n    Q5 --&gt;|REST 经验丰富| REST2[REST]\n    Q5 --&gt;|愿意学习新技术| GRPC3[gRPC]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"混合使用策略\">混合使用策略</h2><p>在实际大型系统中，三种范式往往共存：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    Mobile[移动端] --&gt; GQL[GraphQL 网关]&#10;    Web[Web 端] --&gt; GQL&#10;    ThirdParty[第三方] --&gt; REST[REST API]&#10;&#10;    GQL --&gt; UserSvc[用户服务]&#10;    GQL --&gt; PostSvc[帖子服务]&#10;    GQL --&gt; FeedSvc[推送服务]&#10;&#10;    REST --&gt; UserSvc&#10;    REST --&gt; PostSvc&#10;&#10;    UserSvc &lt;--&gt;|gRPC| PostSvc&#10;    PostSvc &lt;--&gt;|gRPC| FeedSvc&#10;    UserSvc &lt;--&gt;|gRPC| FeedSvc\">flowchart TB\n    Mobile[移动端] --&gt; GQL[GraphQL 网关]\n    Web[Web 端] --&gt; GQL\n    ThirdParty[第三方] --&gt; REST[REST API]\n\n    GQL --&gt; UserSvc[用户服务]\n    GQL --&gt; PostSvc[帖子服务]\n    GQL --&gt; FeedSvc[推送服务]\n\n    REST --&gt; UserSvc\n    REST --&gt; PostSvc\n\n    UserSvc &lt;--&gt;|gRPC| PostSvc\n    PostSvc &lt;--&gt;|gRPC| FeedSvc\n    UserSvc &lt;--&gt;|gRPC| FeedSvc</pre><p>Twitter 就采用了这种混合架构：对外提供 REST API（v2），内部微服务之间使用 gRPC 通信，部分客户端使用 GraphQL 来灵活获取数据。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>REST</strong> 简单成熟、生态丰富，适合公开 API 和简单 CRUD 场景。</li>\n<li><strong>GraphQL</strong> 解决了 REST 的过度获取和不足获取问题，适合多样化客户端场景。</li>\n<li><strong>gRPC</strong> 基于 HTTP/2 和 Protobuf，性能最优，适合微服务内部通信。</li>\n<li>大型系统通常混合使用三种范式——对外 REST/GraphQL，对内 gRPC。</li>\n<li>选型的核心考量：<strong>性能需求、客户端多样性、团队能力和生态支持</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"REST、GraphQL 与 gRPC","id":"rest-graphql-与-grpc"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"API 设计范式概览","id":"api-设计范式概览"},{"level":2,"text":"REST：资源导向的简单哲学","id":"rest-资源导向的简单哲学"},{"level":3,"text":"RESTful API 设计","id":"restful-api-设计"},{"level":3,"text":"REST 的痛点","id":"rest-的痛点"},{"level":2,"text":"GraphQL：客户端驱动的灵活查询","id":"graphql-客户端驱动的灵活查询"},{"level":3,"text":"Schema 定义","id":"schema-定义"},{"level":3,"text":"灵活查询","id":"灵活查询"},{"level":3,"text":"GraphQL 的挑战","id":"graphql-的挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"gRPC：高性能二进制通信","id":"grpc-高性能二进制通信"},{"level":3,"text":"Protocol Buffers 定义","id":"protocol-buffers-定义"},{"level":3,"text":"gRPC 的四种通信模式","id":"grpc-的四种通信模式"},{"level":2,"text":"三种范式对比","id":"三种范式对比"},{"level":3,"text":"选型决策树","id":"选型决策树"},{"level":2,"text":"混合使用策略","id":"混合使用策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"DNS 与 CDN","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-design/networking-and-protocols/dns-and-cdn"},"next":{"title":"关系型数据库","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-design/storage-and-databases/relational-databases"}}